    "sectionSubtitle": {
      "vi": "\nHệ sinh thái dịch vụ danh cho nghỉ dưỡng, công tác và trải nghiệm ẩm thực thượng hạng.",
      "en": "A full ecosystem for leisure, work, and elevated dining."
    },
    "items": [
      {
        "title": {
          "vi": "Warmest Greeting from The Breathe Spa & Beauty",
          "en": "Signature Spa"
        },
        "desc": {
          "vi": "We invite you to relax and pamper yourself with one of our revitalising spa experience. Let us calm your mind and help get you away from your busy everyday life. You deserve to enjoy our experience. The Breathe Spa & Beauty is a professional team, trained at prestigious schools, with the ongoing promotions, we are proudly brings a comprehensive beauty care to all of you. The program will offer special prices for customers who have different needs. Spa carries one specific characteristics in order to create conditions for all customers to join The Breathe Spa & Beauty. The Breathe Spa & Beauty provides services to promote health, relaxation, and beauty including : Body Treatment ,Facial Care ,Express Treatment, Body Wrap ,Body Exfoliate ,Special Package,Manicure And Pedicure ,Hair Wash ,Eyelash Extension, Eyelash Perm. The Breathe Spa & Beauty offers a luxurious retreat, elegantly designed single, double and triple treatment rooms, Jacuzzi bath , sauna and steam and an extensive range of wellness services. Its comprehensive therapies, combined with natural products.",
          "en": "Lieu trinh tri lieu chuyen sau voi khong gian rieng tu va doi ngu therapist chuan quoc te."
        },
        "image": "/photos/gsp-25.jpg",
        "alt": "The Breathe Spa"
      },
      {
        "title": {
          "vi": "Cowboy Bar",
          "en": "Infinity Pool"
        },
        "desc": {
          "vi": "- Vị trí: Tầng 7 - Giờ hoạt động: 10:00 ~ 22:00 - Ẩm thực: Các món snacks / Draft Beer / Cocktail - Khác: - Hồ bơi: Độ sâu từ 1m5 - Chươngtrình ưu đãi: - 1. Happy Hour: 12:00 –16:00 Mua 1 tặng 1 (chỉ áp dụng - Cocktail & Mocktail) - 2. Lucky Wheel: 10:00 – 12:00 Trò chơivòng quay may - mắnnhậnưuđãi - 3. Beer O’clock: All Day Mua 1 tặng 1 Beer Draft - 4. TặngSnack miễnphívớibấtkỳorder - 5. Floating Tray: 720.000 VND / tray",
          "en": ""
        },
        "image": "/photos/gsp-08.jpg",
        "alt": "Cowboy Bar và hồ bơi"
